      "sourceTextSha256": "c70cd24fc39edb945abca2c3e1302dad9791201991522644e0607b4220b642d8",
      "text": "\n\n## Trip highlights\n\nThe trip begins in Venezuela. After exploring Caracas, spend time in the Los Roques archipelago before heading to Canaima and Angel Falls. The itinerary also takes you to the Santa Teresa estate, with its sugarcane fields and a rum tasting.\n\nAfter flying to Bolivia, continue in La Paz and the country’s southwest. The itinerary takes in the Witches’ Market, Moon Valley, the Uyuni Salt Flat, Incahuasi Island with its giant cacti, the Train Cemetery, the Valley of the Rocks, lagoons, the Stone Tree, the Sol de Mañana geysers, hot springs, the Salvador Dalí Desert and Laguna Verde at the foot of Licancabur.\n",
      "provenance": {
